From 67bacc4840b76c74f0244712f417c7d1488c15c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 23:02:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] hexagonfs: add writable mapped directories

Add operations to create, write, truncate, sync, rename and remove files
and a mapped directory type that implements them for all files below
it. Read-only directories return -EROFS for these operations.

The sensor registry on the sensor DSP needs this to save its state.

Signed-off-by: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
